// Multi-target phantasmal terror, same straight-damage GroundAoe shape as
// dark_star.ron scaled for circle 9 -- damage is the spell's own
// description centerpiece ("torn at by an unreal predator that gnaws
// their thoughts"). Sheet's secondary fear rider dropped: `pooled_debuff`
// (the only path to attach a buff on a GroundAoe) fully replaces the
// normal damage strike, and this cell already has two pooled-debuff fear/
// hold spells (regal_presence.ron, mental_prison.ron via BasicRanged) --
// keeping weird as the raw-damage circle-9 capstone gives the wave real
// mechanical variety instead of every high-circle Illusion/Enchantment
// spell converging on the same CC shape.
GroundAoe(
    energy_cost: 210.0,
    buildup_duration: 0.7,
    delay: 0.5,
    recover_duration: 0.5,
    max_range: 37.0,
    radius: 6.0,
    min_falloff: 0.4,
    damage: 95,
    poise: 20,
    knockback: (strength: 0.0, direction: Away),
    dodgeable: Roll,
    reagent: None,
    rooted_cast: false,
    meta: (
        school: Some(Illusion),
        source: Some(Arcane),
        // level 9 spell -> min_level 54, the level * 6 convention.
        requirements: (min_level: Some(54)),
    ),
)
